# Generated inputs and run data. The final results are published: the sample run, statistics,
# logs, reports, charts and the presentation. The saved runs in runs/ and their manifest only let
# an interrupted suite carry on, and `generate --suite` reproduces the inputs, so they stay local,
# as do other runs' folders.
data/generated/
results/*
!results/final_presentation.pdf
!results/sample/
!results/*.csv
!results/report.md
!results/by_config/
!results/charts/
!results/samples/
!results/cases/
!results/express/
results/cases/*
results/express/*
!results/cases/*.csv
